#: ../developer/automation-score.md:36
msgid ""
"A signal without enough data is dropped and the remaining weights are re-"
"normalized. It never counts as `0`, which would wrongly pull the score "
"toward human. The weights total `1.15`; the score always divides by the "
"weight available."
msgstr ""
"数据不足的信号会被丢弃，其余权重重新归一化。缺失的信号绝不按 `0` 计算，否则会错误地把分数拉向“真人”。权重合计为 "
"`1.15`；评分总是除以实际可用的权重。"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:38
msgid "1. `turn_pattern`: user turns"
msgstr "1\\. `turn_pattern`：用户轮次"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:40
msgid ""
"An interactive session resends a growing history, so `num_user_turns` "
"climbs `1, 2, 3, …`. A script that fires independent completions sends "
"`num_user_turns = 1` almost every time."
msgstr ""
"交互式会话会重新发送不断增长的历史，因此 `num_user_turns` 依次递增 `1, 2, 3, …`。发出独立 completion "
"的脚本几乎每次都发送 `num_user_turns = 1`。"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:48
msgid ""
"`depth_factor` halves the sub-score for a user who holds deep threads, so"
" a person who also sends many one-shot requests is not marked as a "
"script."
msgstr "对于有过深层多轮对话的用户，`depth_factor` 会把子分数减半，这样同时也发送大量单轮请求的真人不会被判为脚本。"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:50
msgid "2. `prompt_size_dispersion`: turn length"
msgstr "2\\. `prompt_size_dispersion`：轮次长度"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:52
msgid ""
"`api_logs` has no per-role token counts, so this signal uses "
"`prompt_tokens`: the whole input of a request, with the system prompt, "
"the resent history, tool definitions and the latest message. A template "
"produces near-constant sizes; a person's requests vary from a one-word "
"follow-up to a long paste. The signal measures the relative spread (IQR /"
" median), which ignores scale and resists one huge prompt:"
msgstr ""
"`api_logs` 没有按角色区分的 token 计数，因此这个信号使用 "
"`prompt_tokens`：请求的全部输入，包括系统提示词、重新发送的历史、工具定义和最新一条消息。模板生成的请求大小几乎不变；真人的请求则从一个词的追问到一大段粘贴，变化很大。该信号衡量相对离散度（IQR"
" / 中位数），它与规模无关，也不受单个超大提示词影响："

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:59
msgid "3. `client_tool_prior`: user-agent"
msgstr "3\\. `client_tool_prior`：user-agent"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:61
msgid ""
"The User-Agent is the easiest signal to fake, so it is a soft, low-weight"
" prior. Each request's User-Agent falls into a client class (a Python "
"port of the frontend's `parseClientTool`) with an automation value:"
msgstr ""
"User-Agent 是最容易伪造的信号，因此只作为权重较低的软先验。每个请求的 User-Agent 被归入一个客户端类别（前端 "
"`parseClientTool` 的 Python 移植），每个类别有一个自动化取值："

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:5
msgid "Client class"
msgstr "客户端类别"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:5
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "示例"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:5
msgid "Value"
msgstr "取值"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:5
msgid "Interactive / coding agent"
msgstr "交互式 / 编码 agent"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:5
msgid "`claude-code`, `cline`, `cursor`, `codex`, `browser`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:5
msgid "`0.10`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:5
msgid "Ambiguous SDK"
msgstr "无法区分的 SDK"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:5
msgid "`openai-python`, `openai-node`, `anthropic-python`/`-sdk`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:5
msgid "`0.50`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:5
msgid "Raw HTTP library / API tool"
msgstr "原始 HTTP 库 / API 工具"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:5
msgid ""
"`python-requests`, `httpx`, `aiohttp`, `curl`, `wget`, `okhttp`, `axios`,"
" `go-http`, `postman`, …"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:5
msgid "`0.85`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:5
msgid "Unknown (recognized leading token)"
msgstr "未知（能识别出前导 token）"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:5
msgid "`myagent/1.0`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:5
msgid "`0.60`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:5
msgid "Absent / unrecognized UA"
msgstr "缺失 / 无法识别的 UA"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:5
msgid "—"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:5
msgid "`0.70`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:76
msgid ""
"SDKs are neutral because a chat UI can run on `openai-python`. The "
"`agent_share` term lets a coding-agent opener (signal 6) pull toward "
"human even behind a script-like User-Agent."
msgstr ""
"SDK 取中性值，因为聊天界面也可能基于 `openai-python` 运行。`agent_share` 项让编程 agent 开场白（信号 "
"6）即使在像脚本的 User-Agent 背后也能把分数拉向真人。"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:78
msgid "4. `daily_activity_shape`: daily activity"
msgstr "4\\. `daily_activity_shape`：每日活动"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:80
msgid ""
"This is the hardest behavior to fake at scale. Up to four parts are "
"combined, re-normalized over those that have enough data; high means "
"automated:"
msgstr "这是最难大规模伪造的行为。最多四个部分合并计算，并在数据足够的部分之间重新归一化；越高越像自动化："

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:5
msgid "Part"
msgstr "分项"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:5
msgid "Weight"
msgstr "权重"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:5
msgid "Formula"
msgstr "公式"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:5
msgid "Floor"
msgstr "数据下限"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:5
msgid "Hour coverage"
msgstr "小时覆盖率"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:5
msgid "0.20"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:5
msgid ""
"`clamp01((coverage - 0.5) / 0.5)`, `coverage = distinct active UTC hours "
"/ 24`"
msgstr ""
"`clamp01((coverage - 0.5) / 0.5)`，其中 `coverage = distinct active UTC "
"hours / 24`——有活动的不同 UTC 小时数除以 24"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:5
msgid "`N ≥ 10`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:5
msgid "Hour entropy"
msgstr "小时熵"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:5
msgid ""
"`clamp01((Hnorm - 0.5) / (0.92 - 0.5))`, `Hnorm = ShannonEntropy(hours) /"
" log2(24)`; the part saturates at the tuning constant `0.92`"
msgstr ""
"`clamp01((Hnorm - 0.5) / (0.92 - 0.5))`，`Hnorm = ShannonEntropy(hours) / "
"log2(24)`；该部分在调优常数 `0.92` 处饱和"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:5
msgid "Nightly rest gap"
msgstr "夜间休息间隙"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:5
msgid "0.30"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:5
msgid "`clamp01(1 - max_quiet_gap_hours / 6)`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:5
msgid "Inter-arrival regularity"
msgstr "到达间隔规律性"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:5
msgid "`clamp01(1 - gap_rcv / 1.0)`, `gap_rcv = (p75 - p25) / median` of gaps"
msgstr "`clamp01(1 - gap_rcv / 1.0)`，其中 `gap_rcv = (p75 - p25) / median`，按到达间隔计算"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:5
msgid "`≥ 3 gaps`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:89
msgid ""
"`max_quiet_gap_hours` is the longest run of inactive clock hours, "
"wrapping past midnight: a person's sleep pushes the rest-gap part toward "
"0, and round-the-clock operation toward 1. Hours are bucketed in UTC. The"
" parts that ignore the timezone (regularity, rest gap and entropy) carry "
"most of the weight, so an unknown timezone shifts the histogram without "
"distorting the result."
msgstr ""
"`max_quiet_gap_hours` 是不活跃整点小时的最长连续段，可跨越午夜计算：真人的睡眠会把休息间隔部分推向 0，全天候运行则推向 "
"1。小时按 UTC 分桶。与时区无关的部分（规律性、休息间隔和熵）占了大部分权重，因此未知的时区只会平移直方图，不会扭曲结果。"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:91
msgid "5. `tool_call_human_tell`: supporting"
msgstr "5\\. `tool_call_human_tell`：辅助信号"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:93
msgid ""
"Tool use (`num_tool_calls > 0`, from OpenAI `tool_calls` or Anthropic "
"`tool_use` blocks) is typical of a coding loop a person drives. It only "
"points toward human: without tool calls the signal is dropped, since no "
"tool use says nothing about automation, and otherwise it never raises the"
" score."
msgstr ""
"工具调用（`num_tool_calls > 0`，来自 OpenAI 的 `tool_calls` 或 Anthropic 的 "
"`tool_use` "
"块）是真人驱动的编程循环的典型特征。它只会指向真人：没有工具调用时该信号被丢弃，因为不用工具并不说明是自动化；否则它也绝不会提高分数。"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:99
msgid "6. `agent_opener_override`: supporting"
msgstr "6\\. `agent_opener_override`：辅助信号"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:101
#, no-python-format, python-format
msgid ""
"`metadata->>'agent'` is a coding-agent identity parsed from the system-"
"prompt opener (`\"You are Claude Code, …\"`). It comes from content, not "
"a header, so it is hard to fake by accident and counts as strong evidence"
" of a person. It is available only when the opener appears on at least 5%"
" of requests, and it only pulls toward human:"
msgstr ""
"`metadata->>'agent'` 是从系统提示词开场白（`\"You are Claude Code, …\"`）解析出的编程 agent"
" 身份。它来自内容而非请求头，很难无意间伪造，因此被视为真人的有力证据。只有当至少 5% 的请求带有这句开场白时它才可用，并且只会把分数拉向真人："

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:107
msgid ""
"It also drives the hard human clamp in [Combining the signals"
"](#combining-the-signals)."
msgstr "它还会触发[组合信号](#combining-the-signals)中的真人硬上限。"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:109
msgid "7. `user_message_shape`: the user's own messages"
msgstr "7\\. `user_message_shape`：用户自己的消息"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:111
msgid ""
"When a request is logged, `user_message_stats` (next to "
"`conversation_shape`) stores three properties of its newest user message "
"as cheap columns: length in characters, Shannon character entropy in bits"
" per character, and a stable 64-bit hash of the stripped text. The score "
"reads these columns, never the stored prompt. Three parts are combined, "
"re-normalized over those with enough data; high means automated:"
msgstr ""
"请求记入日志时，`user_message_stats`（与 `conversation_shape` "
"并列）会把其最新一条用户消息的三项属性存为低成本的列：字符长度、以每字符比特计的 Shannon 字符熵，以及去除首尾空白后文本的稳定 64 "
"位哈希。评分只读这些列，从不读取存储的提示词。三个部分合并计算，并在数据足够的部分之间重新归一化；越高越像自动化："

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:5
msgid "Size dispersion"
msgstr "长度离散度"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:5
msgid "0.40"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:5
msgid ""
"`clamp01(1 - size_rcv / 0.5)`, `size_rcv = (p75 - p25)/median` of "
"`last_user_msg_chars`"
msgstr ""
"`clamp01(1 - size_rcv / 0.5)`，其中 `size_rcv = (p75 - p25)/median`，按 "
"`last_user_msg_chars` 计算"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:5
msgid "`≥ 8 sized msgs`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:5
msgid "Per-message entropy"
msgstr "单条消息熵"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:5
msgid "0.25"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:5
msgid "`clamp01(1 - mean_entropy / 4.0)` (natural language ≈ 4 bits/char)"
msgstr "`clamp01(1 - mean_entropy / 4.0)`（自然语言 ≈ 4 bit/字符）"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:5
msgid "`≥ 5 msgs`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:5
msgid "Cross-message repetition"
msgstr "跨消息重复度"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:5
msgid "0.35"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:5
msgid ""
"`clamp01((1 - distinct_ratio) / 0.5)`, `distinct_ratio = "
"distinct(hash)/count`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:5
msgid "`≥ 8 hashed msgs`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:119
msgid ""
"A template sends messages of near-constant length, low-entropy structured"
" payloads, and the same message again and again; a person varies all "
"three. A script can look human here only by really varying what it sends."
" The columns are filled only for requests logged since they were added, "
"so a user whose requests all predate them lacks this signal: the other "
"six blend as usual, with slightly lower `confidence`."
msgstr ""
"模板发送长度几乎不变的消息、低熵的结构化内容，并且一遍又一遍地发送同样的消息；真人在这三方面都会变化。脚本只有真正改变所发送的内容，才能在这里显得像真人。这些列只为添加之后记录的请求填写，所以请求全部早于这些列的用户没有这个信号：其他六个信号照常合并，`confidence`"
" 略低。"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:121
msgid "Combining the signals"
msgstr "信号的组合"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:141
msgid ""
"Re-normalization keeps the blend to the signals that had data, so a user "
"who sends only embeddings (all `num_*_turns` columns `NULL`) is still "
"scored on user-agent and daily activity."
msgstr ""
"重新归一化让合并结果只取决于有数据的信号，因此只发送 embedding 请求的用户（所有 `num_*_turns` 列都是 "
"`NULL`）仍会按 user-agent 和每日活动评分。"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:142
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Shrinkage pulls low-traffic users toward `0.5`. Data and prior weigh the "
"same at `N = 30`; at `N = 5`, `alpha ≈ 0.14`, so the score moves about "
"86% of the way to `0.5`."
msgstr ""
"收缩会把流量少的用户拉向 `0.5`。在 `N = 30` 时数据与先验权重相同；在 `N = 5` 时，`alpha ≈ 0.14`，分数会向 "
"`0.5` 移动约 86%。"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:143
msgid "`confidence` falls with sparse data and with missing signals."
msgstr "数据稀疏或信号缺失都会降低 `confidence`。"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:144
msgid "Users with fewer than 5 requests are flagged `insufficient_data`."
msgstr "请求少于 5 个的用户会被标记为 `insufficient_data`。"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:146
msgid "Bands"
msgstr "档位"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:148
msgid ""
"The score maps to an advisory band. Each band includes its lower bound "
"(`SCORE_BANDS` is scanned from the top with `score >= lower`), so `0.35`,"
" `0.60` and `0.80` fall in the higher band:"
msgstr ""
"分数对应一个仅供参考的区间标签。每个区间包含其下界（`SCORE_BANDS` 从上往下扫描，条件为 `score >= lower`），因此 "
"`0.35`、`0.60` 和 `0.80` 都落在较高的区间："

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:5
msgid "Band"
msgstr "档位"

