#: ../developer/automation-score.md:157
msgid "Caveats"
msgstr "注意事项"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:159
msgid ""
"No single signal decides, and each can be faked on its own, so the user-"
"agent weighs little and behavior dominates."
msgstr "没有哪个信号能单独决定结果，而每个信号单独都可能被伪造，所以 user-agent 权重很低，行为信号占主导。"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:160
msgid "An account used across several timezones can show inflated hour coverage."
msgstr "跨多个时区使用的账户，其小时覆盖率可能偏高。"

#: ../developer/automation-score.md:161
msgid ""
"A shared or team account mixes human and script traffic and rightly "
"scores as mixed. `internal` and `admin` accounts may run automation "
"legitimately; the score ignores roles, so exclude them from any automated"
" enforcement."
msgstr ""
"共享账户或团队账户混合了真人和脚本流量，被评为“混合”是正确的。`internal` 和 `admin` "
"账户可能合理地运行自动化；评分不考虑角色，因此请把它们排除在任何自动处罚之外。"

